  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "brief",
      "x": -520,
      "y": -300,
      "w": 440,
      "text": "THE BRIEF, in the user's words, over five rounds on 2026-09-29. A live grid that fills as you walk and mark, with the camera. Shelves are suggestions you tap to fill, at most 2 m wide. Marks are Section, Counter and Note, with the direction the phone faced. A section runs until you turn, mark another or press Section left, and walking back removes it. Shapes are saved in metres and the grid only helps drawing. A shop has several walks, one is shown to shoppers, and every walk keeps a history you can rewind. Shoppers see a friendly map with no grid, opened from the basket or from a shop's own page. Only accounts with the mapping permission see the walks."
    },
